		(property "Note" "256 Mbit NOR at 1.8 V in 8-WSON 8x6, from a distributor listing; pin order and height not read. The 512 Mbit and 1 Gbit parts of the family fit the same pads and cost three and ten times as much. Needs four-byte addresses. Exposed pad to ground is the usual practice, to confirm. Any 1.8 V serial NOR in this package fits"
